{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Remove the alien Elohim.</b> Far be it, far be it that the prophet should lie with female worshippers of alien Elohim. Its explanation you will find in the section \"Moses went\" (Deuteronomy 31:16)." "<b>And purify yourselves.</b> That they wash the body." "<b>And change your garments.</b> From this place we learn that every Israelite, when he goes to pray in a fixed place, is obligated that his body be clean and his garments clean."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "Resolved פ׳ as standard abbreviation for פרשת, 'the section/portion of,' with the Hebrew phrase וילך משה as its name."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:03.071595949Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}